{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>米特參與了《絕命毒師》全部五季的演出。他本人患有腦性癱瘓，也曾將自身經歷帶入角色。</p>\n<p>除演藝工作外，米特長期參與殘障權益倡議，曾擔任相關機構的形象大使，並創立基金會支持慈善及社區活動。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《絕命毒師》「小沃特」飾演者RJ米特逝世 年僅34歲\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791861252_959408_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>米特離世前仍在宣傳新電影，曾登上播客介紹作品。死訊公佈後，同樣出演《絕命毒師》的Aaron Paul發聲悼念。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《絕命毒師》「小沃特」飾演者RJ米特逝世 年僅34歲\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791861249_859975.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《絕命毒師》「小沃特」飾演者RJ米特逝世 年僅34歲\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791861252_959408_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T05:40:20.614834+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:19:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:51.881300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T05:37:41.128803+00:00","content_hash":"34220c15953c81c9317853fd2981f3ae2519a2ebd8c9ce40514b99837a187ae7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}